{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-choice-growth-FIRST",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Authored from the complete tasks, not a source scan. A plots 2^x with readable increments; B plots 2^x solid and 1.5^x dashed. C plots 2^x solid with y=2 dashed; D plots (1/2)^x solid with y=1/2 dashed. Bases 2 and 1/2 are explicitly representative for the two regimes in 693, not new source givens. No solutions or intersections are annotated.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Authored from the complete tasks, not a source scan. A plots 2^x with readable increments; B plots 2^x solid and 1.5^x dashed. C plots 2^x solid with y=2 dashed; D plots (1/2)^x solid with y=1/2 dashed. Bases 2 and 1/2 are explicitly representative for the two regimes in 693, not new source givens. No solutions or intersections are annotated.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c5-ex",
        "exercise": "687",
        "text": "687. 利用函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象，说明在什么情况下，函数得到较大的改变量：\na) $x$ 从 0.5 变化到 1.5 或从 1.5 变化到 2.5；\nb) $x$ 从 0.2 变化到 0.7 或从 1.2 变化到 1.7."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c5-ex",
        "exercise": "688",
        "text": "688. 在同一张图纸上简略地作出函数 $y=1.5^x$ 和 $y=2^x$ 的图象. 利用图象解方程 $1.5^x=2^x$ 和不等式 $1.5^x<2^x$；$1.5^x>2^x$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c5-ex",
        "exercise": "693",
        "text": "693. 分别在 $a>1$ 和 $0<a<1$ 的情况下，简略地作出函数 $y=a^x$ 和 $y=a$ 的图象. 比较这几个图象的相互位置."
      }
    ],
